OL,3,GNEWSAMen arrested over non-recent child
OL,4,Asex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of rape and sexual offences
OL,8,Fagainst a girl in Bradford in 2008.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said a
OL,11,F41-year-old had been arrested on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of rape and sexual assault.
OL,14,FThe two other men, aged 37 and 40, were
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of arranging the
OL,16,Fcommission of sexual activity with a
OL,17,Fchild. The 40-year-old was also held on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
